  "description": "2.1      Add a single storey rear extension under a hipped tiled roof with dropped eaves to\n2.2\t      Add Conservation rooflights centred in the rear and side roof slopes at a higher level to enable the roof space to be converted to habitable use.\n2.3\t      Replace the up and over steel garage door with a timber vertical boarded door with small paned windows restoring the original design\n2.4\t      Add an Air Source Heat Pump on the side wall enclosed with stained timber louvred enclosure\n2.5\t      Replace the felt covering over the existing bay window with Code 5 leadwork\n2.6\t      Remove and infill the side door and frame with matching brickwork and render\n2.7\t      Introduce an air brick for the kitchen extract fan\n",
